OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a chilly start in
OL,6,Fplaces with any fog slow to clear.
OL,7,FOtherwise dry with variable cloud
OL,8,Finterspersed with bright and sunny
OL,9,Fspells.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry for most with light
OL,12,Fwinds. Overnight frost developing in
OL,13,Fplaces, as well as the odd fog patch
OL,14,Fpossible. Cloudier around the north
OL,15,Fand west coasts, some showers towards
OL,16,FCaithness.
OL,17,
OL,18,CTuesday:FA mostly dry morning with
OL,19,Fbright or sunny spells, the odd shower
OL,20,Faround the coast. Showers spreading
OL,21,Fsouth to all parts later in the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
